-- title:
--   Nonzero tuples weighted by $3/64^{i+1}$ sum to less than $1/20$
-- statement:
--   Let $s\in\mathbb{N}$ and let $T$ be a finite set of nonzero tuples $t\in\mathbb{N}^{s}$. Then
--   $$
--   \sum_{t\in T}\prod_{i<s}\Bigl(\frac{3}{64^{\,i+1}}\Bigr)^{t_i}<\frac1{20} .
--   $$
--
--   Here $t_i$ is the size of moved row $i$. Excluding the zero tuple corresponds to the fact that a bad coloring must move at least one point.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/lean/OAI/Combinatorics/ExpectationThreshold/TupleGeometric.lean#L83-L106

